# Home Lab & Technical Environment

## Overview

My home lab consists of multiple Windows desktop systems, a laptop used for hardware maintenance and Linux experimentation, and a household networking environment configured for improved wireless coverage and wired connectivity.

These environments have provided hands-on experience with hardware assembly, operating system deployment, system optimization, networking configurations, and troubleshooting.

