## Networking Infrastructure

**Household Network Configuration**

Configured and improved a household network using:
- Wireless router.
- Wi-Fi range extenders.
- MoCA networking adapters.
- Existing household coaxial cabling.
- Wired Ethernet connectivity.

**MoCA Implementation**

Implemented a MoCA (Multimedia over Coax Alliance) network to provide wired backhaul connectivity over existing coaxial cabling.

Connected network equipment through coaxial infrastructure to reduce reliance on wireless backhaul and improve available network throughput.

The implementation increased measured network speeds approximately threefold, bringing performance close to the maximum throughput of the 1 Gbps internet service plan.

